---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Workshops | Jeanine" description="Half-day workshops on content models and page structure for teams that run their own site.">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<section>
				<h1>Workshops</h1>
				<p class="lede">A half-day session with your team, in person or on a call, that ends with a written plan your developers can start on the next morning.</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Content models</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>We list the pages you have, the ones you need and the fields each one shares, so new pages are built from parts instead of copied by hand.</p>
					<p>The model is written as an <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/content-collections/">Astro content collection</a>, ready to drop into your repository.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Page structure</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>Every page type gets an order of sections that answers what a visitor asks first, with the links that move them to the next step.</p>
					<p>We check it against your analytics and the <a href="https://web.dev/articles/vitals">Core Web Vitals</a> of the pages you already run.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Handover</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>You keep the plan, the starter repository and a recording of the session. A follow up call two weeks later answers what came up while building.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.content h3 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
	}

	.cta-button {
		align-self: flex-start;
		padding: 0.56em 2em;
		border-radius: 999rem;
		color: var(--accent-text-over);
		background: var(--gradient-accent-orange);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		text-decoration: none !important;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
